Subject: [PATCH] r8s: port opt-in Benly ChargeMax v3 wired policy

Archived v3 baseline: 3e4d20c8b0de6f5d20b701fb8be3fb3cdd409da7dcb01df985598ececd3afaac.
Adapt to Artisan bpf111; preserve SIOP zero, use strict input parsing
and leave mode OFF at boot pending physical validation. No v4 thermal
overrides, forced buck-off, global SIOP lock or UI charging-text override.
Independent thermal/current protections keep their original code and values.

